    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it doesnt feel like a rebalancing though. it feels like the end of the line. like i spent my whole life running toward this one thing, and now that i'm here, there's nothing left to run toward. i've spent ten years building this, and i've nothing left to give. it's like i've finished the book and now i'm just staring at the blank pages at the end. what am i even supposed to do after this?",
