      "content": "but there is no next chapter. that's the thing. i don't want to start over, i don't have the energy to find a new \"who i am.\" i've used everything up just to get here. it feels like there's no point in even trying to find a new beginning when the version of me that actually cared about things is gone. it's just a hollow shell now. isn't it weird that the prize for winning is just realizing you don't want to play anymore?",
